            {
                "entry_id": "d1d90348-ac92-3c5a-bd8f-a50f3ab89425",
                "word": "Tesla",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "87759a1a-8605-4966-970f-69c2a0393f1d",
                        "entry_id": "d1d90348-ac92-3c5a-bd8f-a50f3ab89425",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Teslas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06601408-9083-3213-a183-18567b6b5d41",
                        "entry_id": "d1d90348-ac92-3c5a-bd8f-a50f3ab89425",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A car manufactured by Tesla, Inc., a battery electric vehicle (BEV) automaker founded in 2003."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "defaf5f1-9873-443b-bad9-03ed311ce83e",
                                "sense_id": "06601408-9083-3213-a183-18567b6b5d41",
                                "text": "If they happen to have shares worth a couple of hundred million each, that’s a bonus, but other than their Teslas and Playstations,^([sic]) they can think of nothing they need to spend it on, although if the auto-pilot self-driving software isn’t released soon they’ll have to actually learn to drive rather than just leaving the cars plugged in all day."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "425f69ee-b557-4c99-8d6f-d0d23221ead6",
                                "sense_id": "06601408-9083-3213-a183-18567b6b5d41",
                                "text": "We live in Silicon Valley, home of the gazillionaires you read about with their Teslas and private jets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad761d50-3f0e-4948-9ea6-78a96a9fdddf",
                                "sense_id": "06601408-9083-3213-a183-18567b6b5d41",
                                "text": "Add Teslas to the list of items that are costing more money during the pandemic."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3072c763-208f-4f26-8632-12c1c75ea1a6",
                                "sense_id": "06601408-9083-3213-a183-18567b6b5d41",
                                "text": "I felt deja vu as I recalled a video in which a Tesla owner slammed on the brakes after his car appeared set on crashing headlong into a construction site."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b968d99-4520-44c2-baf1-f50b94a2a789",
                                "sense_id": "06601408-9083-3213-a183-18567b6b5d41",
                                "text": "But we think the wealthy are living in Silicon Valley with their Teslas, at-home espresso machines, and live-in nannies."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
